.TH "CSSFONTFACERULE" "3JS" "April 17, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSFontFaceRule \- CSSFontFaceRule
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]CSSFontFaceRule\f[B]\f[R] interface represents an
\f[CR]\(atfont\-face\f[R] at\-rule.
.SH INSTANCE PROPERTIES
\f[I]Inherits properties from its ancestor \f[CI]CSSRule\f[I].\f[R]
.TP
\f[B]CSSFontFaceRule.style\f[R] \f[I](read\-only)\f[R]
Returns a \f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] object that allows reading
and setting the descriptors of the associated \f[CR]\(atfont\-face\f[R]
at\-rule.
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
\f[I]Inherits methods from its ancestor \f[CI]CSSRule\f[I].\f[R]
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Accessing \(atfont\-face properties
This example defines a \f[CR]\(atfont\-face\f[R] rule and then iterates
over the rules on the page until the associated
\f[CR]CSSFontFaceRule\f[R] is found.
It then logs some of the properties.
.SS CSS
.IP
.EX
\f[B]\(atfont\-face\f[R] {
  \f[B]font\-family\f[R]: \(dqMyHelvetica\(dq;
  \f[B]src\f[R]:
    local(\(dqHelvetica Neue Bold\(dq), local(\(dqHelveticaNeue\-Bold\(dq),
    url(\(dqMgOpenModernaBold.woff2\(dq);
  \f[B]font\-weight\f[R]: bold;
}
.EE
.SS JavaScript
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] myRules = document.getElementById(\(dqcss\-output\(dq).sheet.cssRules;
\f[B]for\f[R] (\f[B]const\f[R] rule \f[B]of\f[R] myRules) {
  \f[B]if\f[R] (rule \f[B]instanceof\f[R] CSSFontFaceRule) {
    log(\(gathis: ${rule}\(ga);
    log(\(ga cssText: ${rule.cssText}\(ga);
    log(\(ga parentRule: ${rule.parentRule}\(ga);
    log(\(ga parentStyleSheet: ${rule.parentStyleSheet}\(ga);
    log(\(ga type: ${rule.type}\(ga);
    log(\(ga style: ${rule.style}\(ga);
  }
}
.EE
.SS Result
